< 040123, JunkerIn
< 
< I found it difficult to get around. I could just be dense or their marketing style leaves something to be desired.
< 
< The base price seems to be ($2.92/mo) $35/yr including the domain name. This is for
< : 50MB, 1GB, 5 Email, 5 Forwards, 5 Auto-responders, ftp, no cgi-bin, SSL
< : and some other seemingly small items I did not bother to track down.
< 
< I went to the Web Hosting page, but that locked up my Netscape 4.5. I went back successfully with Opera 7.2. There I found (UL=unlimited):
< :(limited time offer, first 400 responders!)
< :$8.29/mo ($99.48/yr) DN: inc.
< :300MB, UL throughput
< :UL Email, UL Forwards, UL Auto-responders
< :ftp
< :cgi-bin with PHP 4.31, Python, and Mysql
< :SSL
< :Multimedia
< :Web based control panel
< :E-commerce catalog (I don't know what that might be.)
< :Your own 404 error page
< :30 Day Money Back Guarantee
< 
< Further:
< 
< The Ecommerce option at $9.95/mo or $50.00/yr (I assume DN: inc.) for 50 items/products,
< UPS & Versign compatible.
< 
< And last, I went to my account for http://www.rlmcom.com:
< :55 MB / 5.5 GB
< :Emails: 22, Forwards: 22, AutoResponders: 22
< :Virtual Hosting? yes
< :Catalog? yes
< :Builder? yes
< :CGI-BIN Perl, PHP
< :Cost: $85/yr ($7.08/mo)
